# Hokuno — ホクノ

> Hokuno is a manga streetwear brand specializing in premium print-on-demand collections.

## Brand

Hokuno (ホクノ) is a French streetwear label inspired by manga culture.
All products are printed on demand via Printify — sustainable, zero waste.

## Collections

- **Wanted** — 46 characters × FR+EN × light+dark + mugs. Bounty-poster aesthetic with a 12-year running punchline.
- **Direction** — 10 characters × FR+EN × light+dark + mugs. Motivational manga silhouettes.
- **Mythologie** — 10 designs × light+dark + mugs + phone cases. Divine and mythological imagery.
- **Design Hokuno** — Original Ø brand logo and derivatives. 34 products across t-shirts, caps, polos, swimwear, sandals and phone cases.

## Products

T-shirts, mugs (11oz + 15oz), slim phone cases (iPhone 11–17), caps, bobs, polos, swim shorts, sandals.
All t-shirts are unisex regular-fit, max size XL.

## Pricing

- T-shirts: 34.99€–37.99€
- Mugs: 24.99€
- Phone cases: 24.99€
- Accessories: 24.99€–54.99€

